### ============ SETUP ============

### Health (public)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### Register Thato (409 if already registered, which is fine)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Thato Khonkhe", "email": "thato@example.com", "password": "Password123" }

### Register Lerato (409 if already registered, which is fine)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Lerato Mokoena", "email": "lerato@example.com", "password": "Password123" }

### Login as Thato
# @name thato
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "thato@example.com", "password": "Password123" }

### Import AI sample statement (as Thato)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/import
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=PocketRandBoundary

--PocketRandBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="statement-ai.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/statement-ai.csv
--PocketRandBoundary--

### Summary: September (Thato)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/summary?month=2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Add August data for the comparison: rent
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-08-02", "description": "RENT PAYMENT", "amount": -7500.00 }

### Add August data for the comparison: groceries
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-08-10", "description": "GROCERIES", "amount": -1000.00 }

### Bad month format (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/summary?month=September
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Lerato's September (only her data)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/summary?month=2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{lerato.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Import a statement CSV (as Thato)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/import
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=PocketRandBoundary

--PocketRandBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="statement.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./samples/statement.csv
--PocketRandBoundary--

### Auto-category: Uber Eats (expect EATING_OUT, source RULE)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-09-06", "description": "UBER EATS ORDER", "amount": -145.00 }

### Auto-category: unknown expense (expect OTHER, source RULE)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-09-07", "description": "Something unusual", "amount": -50.00 }

### User's choice wins: Uber but chosen as SHOPPING (expect SHOPPING, source USER)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "date": "2026-09-08", "description": "Uber gift card", "amount": -200.00, "category": "SHOPPING" }

### Budget: Groceries R2,000
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/budgets/GROCERIES
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthlyLimit": 2000.00 }

### Budget: Housing R7,000
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/budgets/HOUSING
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthlyLimit": 7000.00 }

### Budget: Entertainment R500
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/budgets/ENTERTAINMENT
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthlyLimit": 500.00 }

### My budgets for September
GET http://localhost:8080/api/budgets?month=2026-09
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Change Groceries to R2,500 (PUT again replaces it)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/budgets/GROCERIES
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthlyLimit": 2500.00 }

### Income budget (expect 400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/budgets/INCOME
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthlyLimit": 1000.00 }

### Negative limit (expect 400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/budgets/GROCERIES
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthlyLimit": -5 }

### Unknown category (expect 400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/budgets/FOOD
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "monthlyLimit": 100.00 }

### Delete Entertainment (expect 204), then send again (expect 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/budgets/ENTERTAINMENT
Authorization: Bearer {{thato.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Login as Lerato
# @name lerato
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "lerato@example.com", "password": "Password123" }

### Import a PDF statement (as Lerato)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/transactions/import
Authorization: Bearer {{lerato.response.body.$.accessToken}}
